{"created": "2026-01-12T14:18:06.506406+00:00", "modified": "2026-01-12T14:18:07.189472+00:00", "id": 18222225, "conceptrecid": "18222224", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18222225", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.18222224", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18222225", "metadata": {"title": "A Structured Dataset of 174 Classical TCM Formulas: Composition, Dosage, and Roles", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18222225", "publication_date": "2026-01-12", "description": "<p>This dataset presents a curated and structured collection of 174 classical Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) formulas, specifically designed to support computational research in knowledge graph construction, network pharmacology, and data mining. Comprising 1,249 individual records, the dataset transforms unstructured classical literature into a standardized, machine-readable tabular format. It details the precise composition of each formula, including standardized Pinyin formula names, English herb terminology, quantitative dosages with aligned units (e.g., g, ml, Tael), and the canonical \"Jun-Chen-Zuo-Shi\" (Monarch, Minister, Assistant, Guide) compatibility roles. By preserving these theoretical attributions and standardizing measurements, this resource enables researchers to quantitatively analyze herb-ingredient targets and investigate combinatorial patterns within classical prescriptions.</p>\n<p><strong>Contact</strong><br>For questions, please contact:<br>LI Yuanbai:liyuanbai126@126.com</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Li, Yuanbai", "affiliation": "Institute of Information on Traditional Chinese Medicine, China Academy of Chinese Medical Sciences", "orcid": "0009-0003-9775-9856"}, {"name": "Yang, Yang", "affiliation": "Institute of Information on Traditional Chinese Medicine, China Academy of Chinese Medical Sciences"}], "keywords": ["Traditional Chinese Medicine", "TCM Formulas", "Herbal Medicine", "Knowledge Graph", "Classical Formulas", "Jun-Chen-Zuo-Shi"], "dates": [{"type": "issued"}], "version": "v1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "ZZSYS-1901-CZ", "internal_id": "042pgcv68::ZZSYS-1901-CZ", "funder": {"name": "China Academy of Chinese Medical Sciences"}, "title": "Key Laboratory of TCM Language and Cognitive Artificial Intelligence"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "18222224"}}]}}, "title": "A Structured Dataset of 174 Classical TCM Formulas: Composition, Dosage, and Roles", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18222225", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18222225?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18222225", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18222225", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.18222225", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222224", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18222224", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18222224", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.18222224", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:18222225/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:18222225/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18222225/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18222225/access/links", "